You fire a special, electrically charged shot with your steamgun(s) at a spot within range.

When each shot reaches its target, it bursts into electrified shrapnel within radius 2, which shocks each target hit and deals [86%, 97%, 106%, 113%, 120% (TL1-5)] weapon damage as lightning.

Shocked targets lose up to [0, 1, 1, 1, 1 (TL1-5)] non-magical effects (for the first shot that hits).

This talent does not use ammo.
